      "source": "Determines whether this <a href=\"RedisClusterNode.SlotRange.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.redis.connection\"><code>RedisClusterNode.SlotRange</code></a> contains the given <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Integer.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>slot</code></a>, which implies this cluster\nnodes manages the slot holding data stored in Redis.",
